            "sid": "HEB 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu malu atudi tuamba ebu mbualu butamba bunene, Tudi ne muakuidi wa nunku wakashikama ku tshianza tshikole tshia nkuasa wa butumbi wa Mutambe Bunene wa mulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "udi muena mudimu wa muaba mutambe tshijila ne wa tshitendelelu tshilelela tshiakashimikabo kudi Nzambi, katshiakashimikibua kudi muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua muakuidi munene yonso udi musungudibue bua kufileye bintu bihebua ne milambu mishiha; nunku budi muakuidi munene eu nʼabu mbua kuikala ne bintu bia kufileye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, bu yeye muikale ha buloba, yeye kakadi kuikala muakuidi, nasha wa mushindu wonso; bualu bua bakuabo badiku badi bafila milambu bu mudi mikenshi yamba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "badi benza mudimu wabo mu bintu bidi tshidikishilu ne mundidimbi bia bintu bia mu diulu; bu muakadi Mose mudimushibue hakambeye kuasa tshitendelelu, Nzambi wakamuambila ne, Tangila bua wewe wenza bintu bionso bu mudi tshidikishilu tshinakukulesha mu mukuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi mpindiu Kilisto wakuheta mudimu udi utamba butumbi, mûhete nunku bualu bua yeye udi mubatuanganyi wa tshihungidi tshidi tshitamba buimpe, tshiakahungabo ha milayi mitambe buimpe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bu tshihungidi tshia kumudia tshikale tshijalame katshi ne bualu, kabakadi kukeba muaba wa kuhunga tshibidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Nzambi wakabadiula, udi wamba ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
